{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be your avatar anywhere. Vtubing and Game Streaming as your character in a few clicks.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stream yourself in any software where you can pick a camera. Works on Youtube, Discord, Zoom, Twitch, and OBS to name a few. All you need is your regular cam setup to get great 60 FPS head, hand and expression animation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Streamer? Try out our new Stream-Event  feature. Boost monetisation and engagement with overlay animations that sync with the game/event you are streaming. Set up animations that are triggered by keywords/emotes in Twitch, YouTube, and Discord chat. Make animations exclusive to subscribers, trigger when you send a Cheermote, or a message in Super Chat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vtuber who owns your character already on another platform?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can now upload your VRM, GLB/GLTF, and FBX avatar directly to animate it with our system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your Avatar</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your custom head, morph all parts, choose from 50+ hairstyles and 100+ make/face design options. Mix and match bodies and scenes to stand out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Record Videos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Record yourself as an avatar and share it anywhere. Supports up to 10 minute videos at this time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other editing tools include adding filters like night vision and Tetris to your videos as well as layering stickers and gifs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you a 3D artist?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and sell your avatars on our marketplace.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3070550?t=1758757852","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070550/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758757852","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070550/799f062361955ed3435709241a7ca87185931794/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758757852","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070550/799f062361955ed3435709241a7ca87185931794/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758757852","categories":[{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be your avatar anywhere. Vtubing and Game Streaming as your character in a few clicks.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stream yourself in any software where you can pick a camera. Works on Youtube, Discord, Zoom, Twitch, and OBS to name a few. All you need is your regular cam setup to get great 60 FPS head, hand and expression animation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Streamer? Try out our new Stream-Event  feature. Boost monetisation and engagement with overlay animations that sync with the game/event you are streaming. Set up animations that are triggered by keywords/emotes in Twitch, YouTube, and Discord chat. Make animations exclusive to subscribers, trigger when you send a Cheermote, or a message in Super Chat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vtuber who owns your character already on another platform?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can now upload your VRM, GLB/GLTF, and FBX avatar directly to animate it with our system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your Avatar</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your custom head, morph all parts, choose from 50+ hairstyles and 100+ make/face design options. Mix and match bodies and scenes to stand out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Record Videos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Record yourself as an avatar and share it anywhere. Supports up to 10 minute videos at this time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other editing tools include adding filters like night vision and Tetris to your videos as well as layering stickers and gifs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you a 3D artist?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and sell your avatars on our marketplace.</p>","developers":["Pixchange"],"ext_user_account_notice":"https://pixchangeapp.com (Supports Linking to Steam Account)","genres":[{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Utilities","id":"57"},{"description":"Video Production","id":"58"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070550/cb1fa3cc61fb45eb6244cabbed1c1910f8760725/header.jpg?t=1758757852","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"Copyright Pixchange GmbH","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 14<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4000 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2000 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 14<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8000 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2000 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3070550/997025908/a97b7f9c4f958bcc2890faf4afc08d0a51b19685/1758757013/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758757842","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3070550/997025908/a97b7f9c4f958bcc2890faf4afc08d0a51b19685/1758757013/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758757842","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3070550/997025908/a97b7f9c4f958bcc2890faf4afc08d0a51b19685/1758757013/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758757842","id":257205824,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257205824/movie